{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17683","headline":"送李虞仲秀才归东都因寄元李二友 · 杨巨源","name":"送李虞仲秀才归东都因寄元李二友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高翼闲未倦，孤云旷无期。\n晴霞海西畔，秋草燕南时。\n邺中多上才，耿耿丹霄姿。\n顾我於逆旅，与君发光仪。\n同将儒者方，获忝携人知。\n幽兰与芳佩，寒玉锵美词。\n旧友在伊洛，鸣蝉思山陂。\n到来再春风，梦尽双琼枝。\n素业且无负，青冥殊未迟。\n南桥天气好，脉脉一相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}